crates/npc-mist/target/
# Build output of tauri-build, which runs on every `--features desktop`
# build and regenerates `gen/schemas/*.json` from tauri.conf.json +
# capabilities/. Source of truth is those two, not this.
#
# `dist/` is deliberately NOT ignored: unlike `gen/` it holds one committed
# placeholder file. Tauri's config schema requires `build.frontendDist` to
# point at a real directory, even though nothing in it is ever served —
# every window loads a remote `http://127.0.0.1:*` URL instead (see
# src/desktop/).
/gen/
